// state table 0x827D1FA8 (the same on every game), are drawn at random by
// 82432DA0 when the person is set up (8244B268) and again after it drops its
// props (8243CC20, +212 0x1000); the cane, walker, magazine or forty is the
// prop of that walk's animation. A member's copy drew its own. SR1's MP
